WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

00:05.050 --> 00:07.020
I have already told you the method.

00:07.260 --> 00:08.500
What to do

00:08.660 --> 00:10.020
is up to you.

00:10.050 --> 00:12.540
Will you choose the slim chance of being with the one you love for the rest of your life,

00:12.540 --> 00:13.900
or give up the one you love

00:13.900 --> 00:14.980
for the Three Realms?

00:14.980 --> 00:15.510
Liu Shao.

00:15.860 --> 00:17.460
You must make a choice.

00:17.810 --> 00:22.690
[Chapter About Luo Ge]

01:48.990 --> 01:57.690
[Song of the Moon]

01:57.770 --> 02:00.630
[Episode 40]

02:11.740 --> 02:16.610
Don't cling to superficial phenomena, don't get stuck in your own heart.

02:17.870 --> 02:23.370
What you see is not necessarily the truth, you have to keep the purity of your heart.

02:24.380 --> 02:25.890
Luo Ge.

02:26.650 --> 02:29.750
This is the solution I leave you with.

02:30.550 --> 02:35.150
What you see is not necessarily the truth, you have to keep the purity of your heart.

02:36.010 --> 02:40.070
Don't cling to superficial phenomena, don't get stuck in your own heart.

02:47.390 --> 02:48.440
I see.

02:50.329 --> 02:51.640
I get it.

03:13.810 --> 03:15.410
On that day,

03:16.250 --> 03:18.380
I agreed to that three-day aggrement,

03:19.520 --> 03:20.870
and I have been looking forward to the magnificence destined

03:20.870 --> 03:23.050
for me ever since.

03:24.940 --> 03:27.540
I have encountered setbacks countless times,

03:27.920 --> 03:30.980
but I have never regretted agreeing to this agreement.

03:31.410 --> 03:32.540
Today,

03:33.930 --> 03:36.410
I am even more glad that I agreed to this agreement.

03:36.410 --> 03:38.880
Congratulations, Supreme God.

03:43.170 --> 03:47.120
Today I will marry the one I love.

03:48.329 --> 03:50.900
No matter what we have to face in the future,

03:55.680 --> 03:57.360
I have no regrets in my life

03:58.460 --> 04:00.260
to be able to marry him.

04:05.600 --> 04:07.500
This is what I promised you,

04:08.330 --> 04:09.960
and it is also my own wish.

04:12.900 --> 04:15.720
You also promised me that you would be with me forever.

04:15.720 --> 04:17.649
Don't you forget.

04:17.940 --> 04:19.880
I won't.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.380
How I wish

04:51.710 --> 04:53.010
this moment

04:53.430 --> 04:56.210
would last forever.

05:20.400 --> 05:21.610
I'm lucky

05:22.080 --> 05:23.630
to marry Liu Shao as my wife.

05:24.090 --> 05:25.900
This is my blessing in this life.

05:29.590 --> 05:31.150
Now that we are husband and wife,

05:31.150 --> 05:32.810
we must stay together forever

05:33.080 --> 05:34.590
and never be separated.

05:37.030 --> 05:38.540
Never be separated.

05:39.510 --> 05:41.840
Even if I turn into a wisp of smoke and dust,

05:42.110 --> 05:43.960
I will follow you.

05:44.800 --> 05:45.810
No.

05:46.350 --> 05:47.880
I don't want smoke and dust.

05:48.870 --> 05:51.010
I only want you, Luo Ge.

06:21.670 --> 06:22.890
Luo Ge.

06:25.290 --> 06:27.930
No, you shouldn't be...

06:29.650 --> 06:30.450
Luo Ge.

06:30.450 --> 06:31.500
Liu Shao.

06:33.690 --> 06:35.159
I'm sorry.

07:00.400 --> 07:02.080
Luo Ge is so considerate.

07:03.760 --> 07:05.620
I haven't seen him for three days,

07:06.150 --> 07:08.290
and he actually found a wife for me.

07:09.720 --> 07:12.070
Are you waiting for me to come back and enter the bridal chamber together?

07:12.070 --> 07:14.210
That depends on whether you can

07:14.590 --> 07:16.440
stay alive to do that with me.

07:38.659 --> 07:40.040
Do you get so rampant

07:40.970 --> 07:42.770
just because of this formation?

07:45.550 --> 07:47.810
I got an enlightenment from Supreme God.

07:47.900 --> 07:48.740
The solution

07:49.280 --> 07:50.630
is all around me.

07:52.350 --> 07:55.159
Now I have set up a formation to borrow the righteous energy of the Three Realms

07:55.159 --> 07:57.490
to build a boundary beside Xuan Ling Wood.

07:57.680 --> 07:58.940
You can kill that demon

07:59.490 --> 08:00.750
with this formation.

08:01.840 --> 08:03.690
Treat yourself as an ordinary person.

08:03.690 --> 08:05.330
Keep your heart pure.

08:06.130 --> 08:08.460
Don't be distracted by the outside world.

08:08.860 --> 08:12.130
Concentrate on eradicating demons.

08:17.840 --> 08:19.690
The support of Immortal Palace and demon world,

08:19.690 --> 08:21.710
as well as the power of Supreme God Luo Ge

08:21.710 --> 08:23.470
are all in this formation.

08:25.490 --> 08:26.490
You can only use half of your power

08:26.490 --> 08:28.470
here.

08:29.310 --> 08:30.610
It's enough

08:31.450 --> 08:32.460
to deal with you.

10:04.980 --> 10:05.860
Liu Shao.

10:07.420 --> 10:08.930
Time is running out.

10:09.640 --> 10:10.110
Hurry.

10:10.360 --> 10:10.900
Hurry!

10:11.870 --> 10:13.130
Kill me!

10:13.890 --> 10:14.770
Luo Ge.

10:23.290 --> 10:24.050
Luo Ge!

10:25.560 --> 10:26.570
Luo Ge.

10:27.450 --> 10:28.040
Hurry!

10:28.840 --> 10:29.370
Hurry up.

10:29.890 --> 10:31.400
Keep your sense.

10:31.780 --> 10:34.180
I can definitely find a way to deal with him.

10:34.260 --> 10:35.890
I'll keep it.

10:37.830 --> 10:38.750
Luo Ge!

11:20.750 --> 11:21.670
You're so vile.

11:24.400 --> 11:25.960
There can never be too much deception

11:25.960 --> 11:27.600
in war.

11:30.120 --> 11:31.120
Now I have collected the power of the two Supreme Gods,

11:31.120 --> 11:33.770
God of the Moonlight and Supreme God Luo Ge.

11:33.980 --> 11:36.180
Even if you are supported by formation,

11:37.550 --> 11:39.080
you are unable to defeat me.

11:39.650 --> 11:42.130
You should give up fighting back

11:42.340 --> 11:44.440
and just be my bride obediently.

12:00.400 --> 12:02.960
I am the most powerful person in the Three Realms.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.260
Who else dares to stand against me?

12:04.260 --> 12:07.390
All people in the Three Realms are standing against you.

12:11.780 --> 12:14.470
Luo Ge, wake up!

12:18.460 --> 12:20.010
I know you're still here.

12:21.190 --> 12:22.190
Luo Ge.

12:40.130 --> 12:42.460
All beings in the Three Realms, listen up!

12:42.770 --> 12:44.580
God of the Moonlight has returned

12:44.580 --> 12:47.230
after thousands of years.

12:47.600 --> 12:50.420
From now on you can only call me Supreme God.

12:51.090 --> 12:53.480
I have no other names.

12:54.240 --> 12:56.470
My beloved wife, Immortal Liu Shao,

12:57.220 --> 12:59.620
and I will protect our people together.

13:01.040 --> 13:02.300
From now on,

13:03.270 --> 13:06.330
I will be in charge of life and death in the Three Realms.

13:06.970 --> 13:11.880
Humans, immortals, demons and all living beings must be ruled by me.

13:13.060 --> 13:14.950
Survival is my gift to you,

13:15.200 --> 13:17.420
and death is my reward to you.

13:18.890 --> 13:19.610
This

13:20.570 --> 13:22.800
is my oracle,

13:23.470 --> 13:25.400
and it is also your destiny.

13:51.110 --> 13:53.750
You are not able to kill it by being so soft-hearted.

13:53.750 --> 13:56.020
Even if I will die from the backlash of Moon Sword,

13:56.020 --> 13:57.360
I won't kill you.

14:00.350 --> 14:01.400
No, Liu Shao!

14:02.030 --> 14:02.820
No.

14:03.920 --> 14:05.430
I'm Luo Ge.

14:05.760 --> 14:07.230
How could you do it

14:07.650 --> 14:09.310
just to kill that evil spirit?

14:09.880 --> 14:11.480
How could you kill me?

14:13.740 --> 14:14.840
Luo Ge.

14:17.310 --> 14:17.990
Luo Ge.

14:17.990 --> 14:18.700
Luo Ge!

14:20.420 --> 14:21.260
Luo Ge.

14:24.500 --> 14:25.590
Liu Shao.

14:26.390 --> 14:28.700
We all made the same mistakes.

14:29.370 --> 14:31.570
If he is not in Xuan Ling Wood Formation,

14:32.430 --> 14:35.920
the entire Immortal Palace will not be able to defeat him.

14:39.360 --> 14:40.580
Liu Shao.

14:41.510 --> 14:43.270
You have to make a choice.

14:55.620 --> 14:56.420
Liu Shao.

14:56.420 --> 14:57.760
You're finally awake.

14:57.890 --> 14:58.220
Here.

14:58.470 --> 14:59.650
Drink this.

14:59.690 --> 15:00.360
Have I...

15:01.030 --> 15:03.290
Have I been asleep for long? How is it now?

15:04.600 --> 15:06.620
Do you become stupid due to the beat?

15:06.870 --> 15:08.890
You have been asleep all day and all night.

15:08.890 --> 15:10.480
That demon wanted to establish its majesty,

15:10.480 --> 15:12.500
and had already hurt several generals.

15:12.500 --> 15:14.350
Stop thinking about that guy.

15:14.600 --> 15:16.110
Although your external injuries have healed,

15:16.110 --> 15:20.040
the exhaustion of your internal strength still needs to be recovered.

15:20.100 --> 15:22.620
By the way, Luo Ge had something for you.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.060
This...

15:31.860 --> 15:33.160
is from Luo Ge?

15:33.160 --> 15:35.160
Just a few days before your wedding,

15:35.470 --> 15:38.750
he told me to hand it over to you.

15:40.810 --> 15:42.610
Clear Vine has strong medicinal properties,

15:42.610 --> 15:44.460
and together with Baffling Star Stone,

15:44.460 --> 15:45.510
it can break the previously sealed Sun Spirit

15:45.510 --> 15:47.530
in her body.

15:47.780 --> 15:49.210
Give this to Liu Shao.

15:49.210 --> 15:50.610
She knows what to choose.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.910
Luo Ge wanted me

15:54.290 --> 15:56.350
to break the seal of Sun Spirit?

16:02.940 --> 16:06.640
Will you choose the slim chance of being with the one you love for the rest of your life,

16:06.640 --> 16:09.540
or give up the one you love for the Three Realms?

16:10.670 --> 16:12.520
You have to make a choice.

16:33.640 --> 16:36.790
He can still maintain a trace of sanity?

16:45.990 --> 16:47.670
Why are you doing this?

16:49.060 --> 16:51.580
As long as you submit to me obediently,

16:52.670 --> 16:54.980
I can let you own the Three Realms.

16:57.580 --> 16:59.810
If you really think you can win,

17:00.480 --> 17:02.940
you won't waste your time talking to me here.

17:03.800 --> 17:04.930
Or are you afraid

17:05.650 --> 17:08.450
that you won't be able to control Immortal Palace?

17:08.630 --> 17:09.339
Shut up!

17:09.760 --> 17:11.060
I want you to see the Three Realms

17:11.060 --> 17:12.450
surrender to me.

17:15.180 --> 17:16.609
Farewell.

17:20.010 --> 17:20.980
Guards!

17:24.460 --> 17:25.470
Supreme God.

17:25.930 --> 17:27.400
Summon Immortal Liu Shao

17:27.950 --> 17:29.420
to see me.

17:36.850 --> 17:38.360
When the moon falls,

17:38.870 --> 17:41.560
the Three Realms will probably enter the eternal night.

17:41.560 --> 17:42.230
Brother,

17:45.000 --> 17:47.930
should we go to Immortal Palace to see what happened?

17:49.330 --> 17:51.730
No need. I have already made arrangements.

17:54.700 --> 17:56.550
All of this is because of me.

17:57.470 --> 17:58.570
So I should go.

17:58.990 --> 18:00.160
Just tell me

18:00.710 --> 18:02.770
if there is anything you need me to do.

18:04.870 --> 18:07.050
The future of the demon world

18:07.470 --> 18:09.270
and Melody race still needs you.

18:09.780 --> 18:11.380
Just succeed to Demon King,

18:12.130 --> 18:13.810
if I fail to return.

18:15.490 --> 18:16.880
I don't want to be

18:17.590 --> 18:19.520
the King of this demon world at all.

18:20.610 --> 18:22.410
If you don't want the demon world

18:22.550 --> 18:24.140
to be destroyed by me,

18:25.990 --> 18:28.250
you'd better live for thousands of years

18:28.800 --> 18:30.320
and continue to be Demon King.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.110
Otherwise,

18:31.530 --> 18:34.220
the entire Melody race can be ruined by me.

18:36.320 --> 18:37.920
Why are you still capricious

18:38.130 --> 18:39.390
even for now?

18:42.830 --> 18:43.550
Well...

18:45.060 --> 18:47.660
Probably I will still be capricious this time.

18:48.500 --> 18:50.980
You don't have to be mad at me.

18:53.000 --> 18:54.000
It's not worth it.

18:57.320 --> 18:57.990
Fu.

19:01.480 --> 19:02.280
Fu...

19:22.860 --> 19:23.720
What did you do?

19:24.660 --> 19:27.260
Why did you kill innocent people arbitrarily?

19:32.600 --> 19:33.950
I didn't.

19:35.000 --> 19:36.090
I just asked Shang Yurong

19:36.090 --> 19:38.020
to prepare some fine wine for me.

19:38.860 --> 19:41.720
But he said that there is no wine in Immortal Palace.

19:42.140 --> 19:42.810
Liu Shao.

19:43.730 --> 19:44.590
Don't you think

19:45.580 --> 19:47.510
I should teach them a lesson?

19:52.590 --> 19:53.390
Right.

19:53.770 --> 19:54.950
No matter what,

19:55.070 --> 19:57.680
we have to put Supreme God first.

20:01.200 --> 20:01.790
Bai Feng?

20:05.020 --> 20:05.610
Liu Shao.

20:06.490 --> 20:08.220
Bai Feng has sworn to follow me.

20:09.100 --> 20:11.490
From then on, the grudges between the two of you are over.

20:11.490 --> 20:13.220
Don't mention it in the future.

20:13.380 --> 20:13.970
Okay?

20:17.960 --> 20:18.840
Yes.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.860
Is this why you called me here?

20:24.760 --> 20:26.280
I have something else to do.

20:26.280 --> 20:27.680
I'll leave you two alone.

20:28.330 --> 20:29.430
My sweetheart.

20:30.430 --> 20:31.780
What are you busy with?

20:35.050 --> 20:36.710
Are you busy breaking the seal

20:37.620 --> 20:39.090
and becoming a Supreme God

20:40.560 --> 20:42.450
to deal with me?

20:52.270 --> 20:53.200
What did you do?

20:54.630 --> 20:56.050
I'm just warning you.

21:00.590 --> 21:02.310
Just be my wife obediently.

21:03.150 --> 21:05.410
Don't think about doing useless things.

21:08.740 --> 21:09.490
Also,

21:09.960 --> 21:11.760
tell Shang Yurong and the others

21:12.940 --> 21:15.340
to come to Litian Temple tomorrow morning.

21:16.090 --> 21:19.280
I'm going to make up a grand coronation.

21:29.020 --> 21:30.410
So ungrateful.

21:31.840 --> 21:34.100
I'm the future ruler of the Three Realms.

21:34.860 --> 21:36.260
What is she not satisfied

21:37.630 --> 21:39.570
with being able to marry me?

21:41.290 --> 21:43.390
You treat Liu Shao so kindly.

21:44.100 --> 21:46.070
She should be grateful.

21:54.260 --> 21:55.100
Luo Ge,

21:55.940 --> 21:57.330
I'll show you

21:58.510 --> 22:00.370
how the whole Immortal Palace...

22:00.730 --> 22:01.240
No,

22:01.570 --> 22:03.100
how the entire Three Realms

22:03.630 --> 22:07.450
surrender to me.

22:08.710 --> 22:09.260
Tomorrow

22:09.800 --> 22:11.820
is the coronation for that demon,

22:14.630 --> 22:17.560
and it is also the time for us to help Liu Shao seal him.

22:20.720 --> 22:23.650
This matter concerns the safety of the Three Realms.

22:24.710 --> 22:26.310
I absolutely cannot allow that demon

22:26.310 --> 22:27.780
to use Luo Ge's body

22:27.780 --> 22:30.180
to do whatever he wants in the Three Realms.

22:32.740 --> 22:34.470
If you are of the same mind as me,

22:35.000 --> 22:35.890
please help me

22:36.520 --> 22:37.400
tomorrow.

23:02.430 --> 23:04.070
Why couldn't I become Supreme God

23:04.070 --> 23:06.130
even though the seal has been broken?

23:08.770 --> 23:09.770
What should we do?

23:10.240 --> 23:11.210
Tomorrow

23:11.460 --> 23:13.430
is that demon's coronation.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.790
He knew we were going to do this,

23:15.790 --> 23:17.520
so he must have done something.

23:19.570 --> 23:21.620
Help her absorb the power of Clear Vine first.

23:21.620 --> 23:23.010
We still have a tough battle

23:23.010 --> 23:24.310
to fight.

23:27.330 --> 23:28.090
Hurry up.

23:28.090 --> 23:29.290
-Step aside. -Hurry.

24:00.510 --> 24:01.310
Supreme God.

24:01.730 --> 24:03.370
The feast is still being prepared.

24:03.370 --> 24:05.700
Please enter the hall and wait for a while.

24:09.080 --> 24:09.880
Shang Yurong.

24:10.340 --> 24:12.440
You better not do what you shouldn't do.

24:12.440 --> 24:13.910
With my cultivation,

24:14.250 --> 24:16.100
no matter how hard you try,

24:16.850 --> 24:18.530
it will all be in vain.

24:18.910 --> 24:19.670
I dare not.

24:20.300 --> 24:21.500
Please, Supreme God.

24:52.430 --> 24:53.230
Shang Yurong.

24:53.850 --> 24:55.160
Tell them to hurry up.

24:55.530 --> 24:57.000
I don't like to wait.

24:57.170 --> 24:57.900
Supreme God.

24:58.770 --> 25:00.630
You don't have to wait any longer.

25:01.030 --> 25:02.420
Everyone is ready.

25:17.670 --> 25:18.930
How dare you!

25:19.680 --> 25:21.990
You even really set up a formation to deal with me.

25:21.990 --> 25:23.920
But do you think you really deserve

25:24.810 --> 25:25.870
to be my opponents?

25:26.150 --> 25:27.200
Just give it a try

25:27.450 --> 25:28.710
and you'll know.

25:29.680 --> 25:30.900
Go to hell!

25:57.860 --> 25:58.990
It's time to wake up

25:59.330 --> 26:00.300
from your dream!

26:01.010 --> 26:01.600
Liu Shao.

26:02.230 --> 26:04.030
I thought of a way to save myself.

26:04.500 --> 26:06.560
I have cast a spell into the Moon Bell.

26:06.810 --> 26:09.450
If one day I am completely controlled by evil spirit,

26:09.450 --> 26:11.510
you can wake me up through Wang Bell.

26:11.930 --> 26:14.530
Then you need to seal  evil spirit immediately.

26:14.870 --> 26:16.380
You have learned the way of sealing

26:16.380 --> 26:17.730
in Crown Wheel.

26:18.650 --> 26:19.510
You just need to

26:20.460 --> 26:21.590
find the timing.

26:25.160 --> 26:27.340
Although I failed to get back the power of God of the Sun,

26:27.340 --> 26:29.610
Clear Vine helped me improve a lot.

26:30.070 --> 26:32.270
Now all nightmares are coming to an end.

26:44.730 --> 26:46.450
You are nothing but an evil spirit,

26:46.450 --> 26:48.720
and you are not worthy of being Luo Ge at all.

26:48.720 --> 26:50.570
Luo Ge is really amazing.

26:51.450 --> 26:53.380
Haven't I already suppressed him?

26:53.630 --> 26:55.160
How dare he plot against me?

26:57.960 --> 26:59.010
But

26:59.890 --> 27:01.890
you can't break my forbidden spell.

27:02.790 --> 27:03.290
You can't even

27:03.290 --> 27:05.290
get back Sun Spirit's cultivation.

27:05.810 --> 27:07.670
You are not capable of sealing me.

27:11.820 --> 27:12.620
You're right.

27:14.090 --> 27:16.490
Although I can't get the cultivation back,

27:16.780 --> 27:18.460
Luo Ge and I

27:19.300 --> 27:22.190
have countless fellow disciples and friends behind us.

27:22.190 --> 27:23.250
But what about you?

27:24.080 --> 27:25.260
You have nothing.

27:50.250 --> 27:50.840
Luo Ge.

28:02.770 --> 28:03.310
Well.

28:03.940 --> 28:04.660
Okay.

28:05.660 --> 28:07.920
Then I will let Luo Ge come out for a while.

28:09.860 --> 28:11.170
Listen.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.220
Even if you seal me,

28:14.060 --> 28:15.790
Luo Ge will lose everything

28:16.460 --> 28:18.140
and even his life.

28:50.270 --> 28:51.110
Ge.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.210
Liu Shao.

28:59.840 --> 29:00.510
Luo Ge.

29:01.940 --> 29:03.120
Time is running out.

29:03.580 --> 29:05.240
Just do it as soon as possible.

29:12.650 --> 29:13.450
Everyone,

29:14.330 --> 29:16.190
get ready to set up the formation.

31:40.150 --> 31:41.080
Luo Ge.

31:45.650 --> 31:46.540
Luo Ge.

31:47.000 --> 31:47.630
Liu Shao.

31:48.800 --> 31:49.600
Luo Ge.

31:50.610 --> 31:51.410
It's okay.

32:01.450 --> 32:02.160
Luo Ge.

32:11.230 --> 32:11.780
Liu Shao!

32:31.140 --> 32:32.740
How dare you plot against me?

32:33.070 --> 32:34.080
Liu Shao!

32:35.050 --> 32:37.650
You wanna do it the hard way?

32:39.830 --> 32:40.930
Just wait and see.

32:41.930 --> 32:44.390
I will kill all the people in Immortal Palace

32:45.460 --> 32:46.220
and

32:46.890 --> 32:48.090
make you submit to me.

32:56.470 --> 32:58.440
I just like woman like you.

33:06.920 --> 33:07.760
Are you crazy?

33:08.810 --> 33:10.120
What are you doing?

33:17.210 --> 33:17.970
I'm not.

33:18.770 --> 33:21.430
Do you think I really surrendered to you before?

33:22.040 --> 33:23.300
You are nothing.

33:23.890 --> 33:25.350
Luo Ge belongs to me alone.

33:25.700 --> 33:27.360
I'm going to avenge Luo Ge now.

33:28.720 --> 33:30.610
Have you forgotten everything?

33:31.580 --> 33:32.750
That Luo Ge

33:33.510 --> 33:35.310
didn't care about you at all,

33:36.410 --> 33:37.810
nor would he smile at you.

33:38.930 --> 33:40.730
I'm the only one

33:41.030 --> 33:43.030
who would smile at someone like you.

33:45.650 --> 33:47.330
Don't flatter yourself.

33:47.750 --> 33:49.680
Who cares about your smile?

33:50.270 --> 33:51.130
You're nothing

33:51.400 --> 33:53.670
but a bunch of nasty black spirits.

33:54.000 --> 33:55.930
I have been waiting for so many days

33:57.410 --> 33:59.300
just to let you die.

34:27.060 --> 34:30.790
It seems that the Three Realms are really coming to an end this time.

34:32.179 --> 34:32.850
No.

34:33.150 --> 34:35.000
I cannot let the Immortal Palace's ten thousand years of foundation

34:35.000 --> 34:36.260
be ruined.

35:14.890 --> 35:15.690
Even if

35:15.900 --> 35:17.560
I cannot defeat him in the end,

35:17.750 --> 35:19.180
it's my honor to fight against the enemy with you

35:19.180 --> 35:20.230
today.

35:36.060 --> 35:36.730
Brother.

35:36.940 --> 35:37.780
Fu.

35:38.580 --> 35:39.630
What are you doing?

35:39.630 --> 35:40.980
Remember I told you

35:41.900 --> 35:44.160
that I would be capricious one more time?

35:58.450 --> 35:59.980
The power of the Demon King!

36:00.670 --> 36:01.220
Fu!

36:01.640 --> 36:02.400
Stop!

36:02.480 --> 36:04.410
The power of the Demon King has merged with your divine spirit.

36:04.410 --> 36:05.210
You will die.

36:05.590 --> 36:06.390
I will die.

36:07.520 --> 36:08.860
But you will survive.

36:09.620 --> 36:10.250
Right?

36:11.890 --> 36:12.640
Fu!

36:13.110 --> 36:14.030
Stop!

36:14.490 --> 36:17.220
Please stop!

36:32.260 --> 36:33.520
If one of us

36:34.150 --> 36:36.210
has to sacrifice his life for the Melody race

36:36.210 --> 36:37.630
or even the Three Realms,

36:38.730 --> 36:40.330
I hope that person will be me.

36:40.780 --> 36:41.790
Melody race

36:42.590 --> 36:45.120
needs a mature and dispassionate Demon King.

36:45.570 --> 36:46.330
Fu!

36:46.790 --> 36:47.540
Fu!

36:49.270 --> 36:50.110
Brother.

36:52.210 --> 36:54.310
I probably pissed you off again, right?

36:54.310 --> 36:55.060
Fu.

36:57.120 --> 36:58.590
But the mistakes I made

36:59.050 --> 37:00.310
have to be fixed by me,

37:00.820 --> 37:02.370
even if it will cost my life.

37:04.300 --> 37:05.180
Luo Ning.

37:06.400 --> 37:07.160
Brother.

37:08.170 --> 37:09.700
Take care of Luo Ning for me.

37:12.950 --> 37:13.710
Don't go.

37:15.100 --> 37:15.850
Don't!

37:19.590 --> 37:20.640
Black Moonlight.

37:21.560 --> 37:23.890
I will give you back the 30% immortal power

37:24.460 --> 37:26.060
you gave me.

37:50.290 --> 37:51.130
Luo Ning.

37:52.810 --> 37:53.990
Ning!

38:16.330 --> 38:17.680
Fu!

39:19.670 --> 39:21.050
You crazy bastards!

39:21.720 --> 39:23.280
You can't kill me!

39:23.280 --> 39:24.810
Even if I couldn't kill you,

39:25.460 --> 39:27.260
I could suppress you for a moment

39:27.480 --> 39:28.990
with all my water energy.

39:30.250 --> 39:31.450
I'm done with my part.

39:32.520 --> 39:33.440
I'll leave

39:34.030 --> 39:35.460
the rest to you.

39:49.530 --> 39:50.000
Luo Ge!

39:50.660 --> 39:51.170
Luo Ge.

40:02.250 --> 40:03.050
What's wrong?

40:03.550 --> 40:05.410
You think I caused trouble again?

40:10.530 --> 40:11.460
How's your hand?

40:11.790 --> 40:12.330
I'm fine.

40:12.630 --> 40:13.550
Don't worry.

40:15.440 --> 40:16.900
I'm not worried about you.

40:18.800 --> 40:19.560
Fu.

40:20.230 --> 40:20.980
Come back.

40:21.870 --> 40:23.930
You're the Demon King and my brother!

40:24.340 --> 40:25.600
You are more important

40:26.320 --> 40:27.160
than me.

40:27.540 --> 40:28.380
Come back!

40:29.050 --> 40:30.140
Come back!

40:51.810 --> 40:52.690
Liu Shao.

40:54.120 --> 40:55.130
Please.

40:55.840 --> 40:56.810
Kill me.

40:57.440 --> 40:58.200
Okay?

41:02.770 --> 41:04.120
Is there

41:04.830 --> 41:06.430
really no other way?

41:07.770 --> 41:09.300
It has long been integrated

41:09.830 --> 41:11.380
with my divine spirit.

41:12.850 --> 41:14.450
I still have the sense

41:14.870 --> 41:18.000
to send you back to the Xuan Ling Wood Formation that day.

41:24.110 --> 41:25.660
This is the last chance.

41:28.600 --> 41:30.240
You must not hesitate.

41:33.390 --> 41:35.110
You're fighting for me.

41:41.370 --> 41:42.670
You must kill me.

41:50.990 --> 41:51.910
This is...

41:53.340 --> 41:55.340
This is the way to the wedding night,

41:56.070 --> 41:59.130
which can help you get back to Xuan Ling Wood Formation.

41:59.260 --> 42:00.400
God of the Sun?

42:01.910 --> 42:02.750
Liu Shao.

42:03.840 --> 42:05.300
You are different from me,

42:06.280 --> 42:07.540
different from us all.

42:09.090 --> 42:12.290
God of the Moonlight has promised you a magnificent life.

42:12.740 --> 42:15.010
You have an extraordinary destiny.

42:15.560 --> 42:17.160
You were never a shadow of me.

42:17.410 --> 42:18.460
You are Liu Shao,

42:18.750 --> 42:20.560
the Liu Shao who was willing to sacrifice herself,

42:20.560 --> 42:22.820
suppressed demons with her talisman pearls,

42:22.820 --> 42:25.750
and surpassed God of the Sun and God of the Moonlight.

42:27.360 --> 42:28.490
I'm back.

42:30.340 --> 42:31.730
You are so rampant

42:32.360 --> 42:34.160
just because of this formation?

42:38.530 --> 42:39.330
God of the Sun?

42:41.890 --> 42:43.030
This is fate.

42:43.870 --> 42:45.970
You will all be defeated by me.

42:46.930 --> 42:48.570
Take a good look at who I am.

43:16.370 --> 43:17.830
Even if my opponent is fate

43:18.100 --> 43:19.360
this time,

43:21.620 --> 43:22.550
I must

43:23.550 --> 43:24.600
win

43:25.610 --> 43:26.160
for Luo Ge

43:26.830 --> 43:28.030
and the Three Realms.

44:07.190 --> 44:08.160
Luo Ge.

44:09.460 --> 44:10.220
No!

44:15.890 --> 44:16.680
Liu Shao.

44:17.610 --> 44:18.950
You did well.

44:19.790 --> 44:21.350
I'll always be with you.

44:23.610 --> 44:24.290
Even...

44:26.090 --> 44:28.550
even if I turned into a wisp of smoke and dust,

44:29.490 --> 44:31.380
I would always be by your side.

44:33.950 --> 44:35.040
Don't be sad.

44:34.740 --> 44:37.850
♫On rainy days, wind blows smoke♫

44:35.630 --> 44:37.100
I'm always here.

44:37.850 --> 44:39.950
♫Into circles♫

44:39.450 --> 44:41.630
I would like to devote my entire life

44:41.090 --> 44:43.900
♫On both sides, I'm chanting♫

44:42.720 --> 44:43.820
to promise you

44:44.240 --> 44:46.000
♫The night is sleepless♫

44:44.490 --> 44:45.750
to be with you forever.

44:47.340 --> 44:50.330
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

44:48.350 --> 44:49.280
Luo Ge.

44:50.490 --> 44:52.640
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

44:52.680 --> 44:54.270
I'll wait for you to come back.

44:53.100 --> 44:58.470
♫Your promise, my fate♫

44:55.910 --> 44:58.310
We are going to be husband and wife for life.

45:00.030 --> 45:03.260
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

45:00.660 --> 45:01.410
OK.

45:03.260 --> 45:05.320
♫But my heart is still the same♫

45:03.760 --> 45:04.560
I promise you.

45:06.410 --> 45:09.480
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

45:07.800 --> 45:08.720
Luo Ge.

45:09.480 --> 45:11.030
♫Is like the things we went through♫

45:10.400 --> 45:11.620
You promised me.

45:12.290 --> 45:13.720
You promised me, Luo Ge.

45:12.670 --> 45:15.360
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

45:15.780 --> 45:17.580
You will be back, right?

45:15.780 --> 45:17.710
♫The moment we passed each other♫

45:18.380 --> 45:24.090
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

45:24.470 --> 45:29.800
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

45:30.770 --> 45:36.820
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

45:37.200 --> 45:43.410
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can't hear it♫

45:43.410 --> 45:49.630
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

45:49.630 --> 45:54.750
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

45:55.920 --> 46:01.890
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

46:02.190 --> 46:08.290
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

46:08.650 --> 46:15.010
♫If you see me for the first time in this life, I'll forever hold it in my heart♫

46:15.750 --> 46:18.650
♫Get lost in your sky♫

46:18.870 --> 46:21.460
♫Whose wilderness♫

46:22.070 --> 46:26.850
♫Clouds billow up and fade away in the four seas♫

46:28.480 --> 46:31.510
♫The mountains and rivers after the farewell♫

46:31.510 --> 46:33.780
♫Silence♫

46:33.780 --> 46:36.260
♫Time sighs silently♫

46:36.260 --> 46:40.960
♫Whose passing years♫

46:46.450 --> 46:47.450
This is Wang Bell.

46:47.880 --> 46:49.680
Don't forget to keep it with you.

46:50.020 --> 46:51.870
If you are in danger in the future,

46:51.870 --> 46:54.470
my Moon Bell will sense it.

46:55.860 --> 46:59.600
Even if I had to go through thousands of calamities and pass through thousands of years,

46:59.600 --> 47:01.600
I would like to devote my entire life

47:02.410 --> 47:06.440
to promise you to be with you forever.

47:09.260 --> 47:11.110
Fate made a joke.

47:12.700 --> 47:14.260
It took me to find you

47:16.060 --> 47:17.390
and forced me to kill you

47:18.330 --> 47:19.720
with my own hands.

47:21.900 --> 47:23.410
Then

47:25.130 --> 47:26.690
it left me alone

47:28.120 --> 47:29.750
in this world.

47:31.940 --> 47:34.330
It made me keep looking for your shadow

47:35.090 --> 47:37.400
in endless memories,

47:39.040 --> 47:41.090
doing things you haven't finished,

47:44.160 --> 47:45.340
and watching

47:47.310 --> 47:50.590
other people's lives.

47:52.270 --> 47:54.800
Are these people who have appeared in my life,

47:55.500 --> 47:56.840
the fickle life

47:58.650 --> 48:00.190
and the flashy love

48:03.380 --> 48:04.400
illusion

48:06.340 --> 48:07.100
or real?

48:22.820 --> 48:25.150
This is the Three Realms you have guarded.

48:26.510 --> 48:28.170
It is now as peaceful and happy

48:29.110 --> 48:30.540
as you ever wished it would be.

48:29.150 --> 48:33.730
♫I want to get close but I can't see clearly♫

48:32.360 --> 48:33.270
Only

48:34.450 --> 48:39.020
♫Who arranged this rain?♫

48:34.930 --> 48:36.050
you are gone.

48:38.030 --> 48:39.290
There is one more heart

48:39.750 --> 48:41.070
in this world

48:40.130 --> 48:44.650
♫I want to avoid but I meet you again♫

48:42.260 --> 48:43.830
that is half missing.

48:45.370 --> 48:50.070
♫I can't help but stay with you♫

48:46.330 --> 48:48.860
I can't feel the joys and sorrows of the world,

48:49.910 --> 48:51.880
and I can't feel the passage of time.

48:51.240 --> 48:55.710
♫The stars call the morning sky♫

48:53.720 --> 48:55.320
I just hope

48:56.380 --> 49:00.880
♫May you feel relieved♫

48:56.980 --> 48:58.580
my dream can come true.

49:01.640 --> 49:02.480
And you

49:02.140 --> 49:06.650
♫I long for a hug♫

49:07.210 --> 49:12.460
♫Can I not just listen?♫

49:13.110 --> 49:16.560
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

49:13.320 --> 49:14.460
are in that dream.

49:17.160 --> 49:22.770
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

49:23.210 --> 49:28.080
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

49:28.370 --> 49:33.690
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

49:34.800 --> 49:38.460
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

49:38.970 --> 49:44.550
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

49:44.980 --> 49:50.330
♫When will we separate?♫

49:50.510 --> 49:58.290
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

49:57.280 --> 49:59.960
[Soon of the Moon]
